AGREEMENT FOR THE PURCHASE, SALE AND EXCHANGE OF LANDS

This Agreement for the Purchase, Sale and Exchange of Lands (“Agreement”) is made and
effective as of the date of execution (“Effective Date”) of the last signing party below, by and
between Mariah, LLC, a Wyoming limited liability company, having its principal offices at 1813
Pacific Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming 82007 (“Mariah”); Dyno Nobel Inc., a Delaware
corporation, having its principal offices at 2795 East Cottonwood Parkway, Suite 500, Salt Lake
City, Utah 84121 (“Dyno Nobel”); and the City of Cheyenne, a municipal corporation organized
under the laws of the State of Wyoming, having its principal offices at 2101 O’Neil Avenue,
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001 (“the City”).

WHEREAS, Mariah owns the surface and subsurface estate to lands situated in Cheyenne,
Laramie County, Wyoming (“Parcel A”), containing 543.76 acres, having an appraised value of
$1,060,000.00, which parcel is particularly described in “Exhibit A – Legal Description and Map
of Parcel A,” attached to this Agreement and incorporated herein by this reference.

WHEREAS, the City owns the surface and subsurface estate to lands situated in Cheyenne,
Laramie County, Wyoming (“Parcel B”), containing 419.37 acres, having an appraised value of
$1,004,000.00, which parcel is particularly described in “Exhibit B – Legal Description and Map
of Parcel B,” attached to this Agreement and incorporated herein by this reference.

WHEREAS, Dyno Nobel desires to acquire Parcel B.

WHEREAS, Mariah desires to sell Parcel A.

WHEREAS, the City desires to trade Parcel B for Parcel A.

NOW THERFORE, in consideration of the mutual benefits and obligations set forth in this
Agreement:

1. Subject to the terms and conditions set forth in Paragraphs 3-17.

a. Mariah agrees to sell to Dyno Nobel, and Dyno Nobel agrees to purchase from Mariah,
Parcel A; and

b. At the closing, Mariah  shall convey Parcel A to the City pursuant to Wyo. Stat. Ann. §
15-1-112(b)(ii) (Lexis 2017); and

c. In consideration of the purchase of Parcel A by Dyno Nobel and the conveyance by Mariah
of Parcel A to the City, the City agrees to pay Dyno Nobel $117,500.00 and convey Parcel
B to Dyno Nobel pursuant to Wyo. Stat. § 15-1-112(b)(ii).

d. It is understood by the City that Dyno Nobel is only agreeing to purchase Parcel A with
the promise by the City that it will pay Dyno Nobel $117,500.00 and convey Parcel B to
```

